Migration `0042_add_settlement_currency` was the second step of the `v412` release job and ran at 14:05. In a single transaction it adds `ledger_entries.settlement_currency`, sets it to `'USD'` on the existing rows, and then makes it `NOT NULL` with no default:

```sql
