ALTER TABLE ledger_entries ALTER COLUMN settlement_currency SET NOT NULL;
```

`v411` never writes that column, so after 14:05 every `v411` insert failed with a not-null violation. That is why reverting the config to `legacy` and rolling back to `v411` both failed, and why the only fix was to roll forward to `v412`.
